Work Order CS-004368 (Acceptance channel: Online Customer Service Transfer Work Order), created on 2026-10-17 08:37

[Original Customer Statement]
Hello, I am C-09422. On 2026-11-03, I ordered a box of infant formula milk powder (batch B-21234, 6 cans, final price 1280 yuan) on your platform, delivered on the afternoon of 2026-11-25. That night, when the can was opened and mixed, the formula was found to be clumped and had a sour smell. The child drank about half a cup and vomited three times in the middle of the night. The next day, they went to the community health service center, where the doctor said it was an acute gastrointestinal reactivity and advised them to stop the formula for now.
I contacted logistics, and a logistics dispatcher replied that the truck had been stuck at the transfer station for nearly 9 hours, and the cold chain carriage had lost power midway. He couldn't say how long the outage lasted. I demand a full refund of 1280 yuan, and you also have to cover the 286 yuan examination fee for the child's medical visits.

[Customer Service Verification Notes]
1. The customer has uploaded photos of the can, showing obvious clumping, and the packaging batch matches the outbound records;
2. The client provides a screenshot of the medical record, with the date matching the complaint date;
3. The logistics side confirmed that the cold chain temperature record for this train was missing for 9 hours, and a logistics dispatcher's verbal account matched the backend trajectory;
4. According to After-Sales Rule 4.1: For food categories and customer feedback involving personal discomfort, the case will be transferred to manual review and automatic refunds are not applicable; At the same time, since the food can has been opened, exchanges and reshipments are not supported; only refunds are processed, with a maximum refund amount capped at 1280 yuan per ping;
5. Severity scoring: Food category 2 points + Personal discomfort 2 points + Single actual payment over 2000 yuan 1 point = 5 points (Scale: 0-1 mild, 2 average, 3-4 severe, 5 or above very serious).

[Unrelated] Additionally: TK-20260922-7646 is the delivery time for stroller parts inquired about by the customer last week, unrelated to this order, do not combine and process.
